* text=auto eol=lf
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# The vendored Arlington PDF Model stays byte for byte what upstream publishes: its lock
# (tools/AdCodicem.Pdf.Arlington/model/model.lock) holds each file's SHA-256, so no line ending is converted.
tools/AdCodicem.Pdf.Arlington/model/** -text
